(h) Alternative certified statement for certain nurses. (1) CGFNS is authorized to issue certified statements under section 212(r) of the Act for aliens seeking to enter the United States to perform labor as nurses. The DHS will notify the public of new organizations that are approved to issue certified statements through notices published in the Federal Register.
(2) An approved credentialing organization may issue a certified statement to an alien if each of the following requirements is satisfied:
